# Backend Integration Spec: Leagues, Standings, Team Calendar

This document defines the API endpoints, data models, and validation rules for the new League Management System.

## 1. Leagues Module

### 1.1 Enumerations

```typescript
export enum LeagueLevel {
  INTERNATIONAL = 'INTERNATIONAL',
  CONTINENTAL = 'CONTINENTAL',
  NATIONAL = 'NATIONAL',
  REGIONAL = 'REGIONAL',
}

export enum LeagueFormat {
  ROUND_ROBIN = 'ROUND_ROBIN',
  GROUPS = 'GROUPS',
  SWISS = 'SWISS',
  LADDER = 'LADDER',
}

export enum LeagueStatus {
  REGISTRATION = 'REGISTRATION',
  ONGOING = 'ONGOING',
  FINISHED = 'FINISHED',
}
```

### 1.2 Data Model: [League](file:///Users/khalilmouscou/Documents/_Esprit/projet%20Integr%C3%A9/Backend%20Nest/arena_chain/src/league/schemas/league.schema.ts#26-55)

```typescript
export interface League {
  _id: string;
  name: string;
  level: LeagueLevel;
  regionId: string;
  gameId: string;
  format: LeagueFormat;
  startDate: string; // ISO Date String
  endDate: string;   // ISO Date String
  maxTeams: number;
  status: LeagueStatus;
  createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
}
```

### 1.3 Validation Logic (Region)

The `regionId` field has strict validation based on the `level` of the league:

| League Level | Validation Rule | `regionId` Value |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `INTERNATIONAL` | Must be 'Global' (or empty) | `"Global"` |
| `CONTINENTAL` | Must be a valid Continent | One of: `"Africa"`, `"Asia"`, `"Europe"`, `"North America"`, `"Oceania"`, `"South America"`, `"Antarctica"` |
| `NATIONAL` | Must be a valid Country | e.g., `"France"`, `"Tunisia"`, `"United States"`, etc. |
| `REGIONAL` | Free text | Any non-empty string |

### 1.4 Endpoints

#### **GET** `/leagues/enums/regions`
Returns the list of valid Continents and Countries to populate your dropdowns.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "continents": [
    "Africa",
    "Antarctica",
    "Asia",
    "Europe",
    "North America",
    "Oceania",
    "South America"
  ],
  "countries": [
    "Afghanistan",
    "Albania",
    "Algeria",
    "...",
    "Zimbabwe"
  ]
}
```

#### **POST** `/leagues` (Create League)
**Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "African Champions Cup",
  "level": "CONTINENTAL",
  "regionId": "Africa",
  "gameId": "game_123",
  "format": "GROUPS",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00Z",
  "maxTeams": 16,
  "status": "REGISTRATION"
}
```

#### **GET** `/leagues` (List All)
Returns: `League[]`

#### **GET** `/leagues/:id` (Get One)
Returns: [League](file:///Users/khalilmouscou/Documents/_Esprit/projet%20Integr%C3%A9/Backend%20Nest/arena_chain/src/league/schemas/league.schema.ts#26-55)

#### **PATCH** `/leagues/:id` (Update)
**Body:** Partial object (e.g., `{ "status": "ONGOING" }`)

#### **DELETE** `/leagues/:id` (Delete)

---

## 2. Standings Module

### 2.1 Data Model: [Standings](file:///Users/khalilmouscou/Documents/_Esprit/projet%20Integr%C3%A9/Backend%20Nest/arena_chain/src/standings/schemas/standings.schema.ts#6-32)

```typescript
export interface Standings {
  _id: string;
  leagueId: string;
  teamId: string;
  played: number;
  wins: number;
  losses: number;
  draws: number;
  points: number;
  rank: number;
  createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
}
```

### 2.2 Endpoints

#### **POST** `/standings` (Create Record)
**Body:**
```json
{
  "leagueId": "league_abc",
  "teamId": "team_xyz",
  "played": 10,
  "wins": 8,
  "losses": 2,
  "draws": 0,
  "points": 24,
  "rank": 1
}
```

#### **GET** `/standings` (List All)
*Note: You will typically filter this list on the frontend by `leagueId`.*

#### **PATCH** `/standings/:id` (Update)
**Body:** Partial object

#### **DELETE** `/standings/:id` (Delete)

---

## 3. Team Calendar Module

### 3.1 Enumerations
```typescript
export enum TeamCalendarEntryStatus {
  CONFIRMED = 'CONFIRMED',
  RESCHEDULED = 'RESCHEDULED',
}
```

### 3.2 Data Model: [TeamCalendarEntry](file:///Users/khalilmouscou/Documents/_Esprit/projet%20Integr%C3%A9/Backend%20Nest/arena_chain/src/team-calendar-entry/schemas/team-calendar-entry.schema.ts#11-28)

```typescript
export interface TeamCalendarEntry {
  _id: string;
  teamId: string;
  matchId: string;
  scheduledStart: string; // ISO Date String
  scheduledEnd: string;   // ISO Date String
  status: TeamCalendarEntryStatus;
  createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
}
```

### 3.3 Endpoints

#### **POST** `/team-calendar-entries` (Create Entry)
**Body:**
```json
{
  "teamId": "team_xyz",
  "matchId": "match_uvw",
  "scheduledStart": "2024-01-15T18:00:00Z",
  "scheduledEnd": "2024-01-15T20:00:00Z",
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}
```

#### **GET** `/team-calendar-entries` (List All)
*Note: Filter by `teamId` or `matchId` as needed.*

#### **PATCH** `/team-calendar-entries/:id` (Update)
**Body:** Partial object

#### **DELETE** `/team-calendar-entries/:id` (Delete)
